{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"behavioral manipulation by ai behavioral manipulation by ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md","fileName":"Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Behavioral Manipulation by AI","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Ethics and Digital Power]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"behavioral manipulation by ai behavioral manipulation by ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md","fileName":"Behavioral Manipulation by AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Behavioral Manipulation by AI","heading":"Behavioral Manipulation by AI","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Behavioral manipulation by AI uses profiling, prediction, and adaptive presentation to steer choices in ways that primarily serve the system's operator. Personalized messages can exploit a person's vulnerabilities while concealing the purpose or method of influence.\n\nThe difference between assistance and manipulation depends on autonomy, transparency, and whose goals control the intervention. A recommendation that supports a user's chosen end differs from one designed to capture attention or produce compliance. At scale, manipulation can also affect democratic debate by targeting groups with different messages and weakening a shared basis for public judgment.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and D